INSERT INTO `health_item_sections` (`id`, `health_item_id`, `images`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(2, 2, '[\"uploads/health_item_sections/13967350-6d7a-432c-aa0f-276754f884c7.jpeg\"]', 'Studying abroad is a life-changing experience, but it also comes with responsibilities—especially when it comes to your health. At Insaf Immigration, we understand that your well-being is your most valuable asset. That’s why we offer tailored, reliable, and affordable health insurance solutions designed specifically for students pursuing education overseas.<br><br>Our Health Insurance Services ensure that you are fully protected, meet all visa requirements, and enjoy your international study journey with complete peace of mind.', '2025-12-18 00:21:32', '2026-01-15 06:30:58'),
(3, 3, '[]', '<p>Health insurance is not just a legal requirement; it is a smart investment in your safety and future. Medical treatment in foreign countries can be costly, and without proper coverage,<br>even minor illnesses or emergencies can become overwhelming. </p><p>With Insaf Immigration, you get:<br>• Financial Security: Avoid unexpected medical bills and emergency costs.<br>• Access to Top Healthcare: Receive treatment at hospitals and clinics worldwide.<br>• Visa Compliance: Meet the mandatory insurance requirements for countries such as Australia, Canada, Malta, Malaysia, Russia, South Korea, and European nations.<br>• Peace of Mind: Focus on your studies knowing you are fully covered.</p>', '2026-01-15 06:33:46', '2026-01-15 06:33:46'),
(4, 4, '[]', '<p>At Insaf Immigration, we provide student-focused health insurance that is:<br>• Comprehensive – Covers medical emergencies, hospitalization, surgeries, prescriptions,<br>and more.<br>• Flexible – Plans designed for short-term and long-term study programs.<br>• Global – Access to top hospitals and medical professionals worldwide.<br>• Affordable – Competitive pricing without compromising coverage.<br><br>Key Features of Our Health Insurance Plans<br>1. Medical Coverage: Hospitalization, doctor visits, surgeries, and prescribed medications.<br>2. Emergency Assistance: 24/7 support during medical emergencies, including hospital<br>referrals and ambulance services.<br>3. Mental Health Support: Counseling and therapy for stress, anxiety, or adjustment<br>challenges.<br>4. Travel &amp; Accident Protection: Coverage for accidents and emergencies during travel or<br>local commuting.<br>5. Visa Compliance Support: Insurance plans tailored to meet the requirements of your<br>destination country’s immigration laws.</p>', '2026-01-15 06:34:49', '2026-01-15 06:34:49'),
(5, 5, '[]', '<p>We are not just an education consultancy—we are your trusted partner in international education. With Insaf Immigration, you benefit from:<br>• Verified Providers: Only reliable and globally recognized insurance companies.<br>• Hassle-Free Process: We handle all paperwork, documentation, and approvals.<br>• 24/7 Customer Support: Assistance for claims, emergencies, or general guidance while abroad.<br>• Customized Plans: Insurance coverage tailored to your study duration, destination country, and personal needs.<br>• Peace of Mind for Parents: Families can rest assured that their children are fully protected abroad.<br><br>Step-by-Step Process to Secure Your Health Insurance<br>1. Consultation: Our experts evaluate your study program, destination, and duration.<br>2. Plan Selection: We guide you in choosing the best insurance plan that meets your needs and visa requirements.<br>3. Documentation: We prepare and provide all required insurance documents for your visa application.<br>4. Activation: Your insurance becomes active before departure, ensuring coverage from day one abroad.</p>', '2026-01-15 06:37:30', '2026-01-15 06:37:30'),
(6, 6, '[]', '<p>Different countries have different requirements for student health insurance:<br>• Australia: Mandatory Overseas Student Health Cover (OSHC).<br>• Canada: Provincial health coverage or private insurance is required.<br>• Malaysia: Health insurance is mandatory for student visa holders.<br>• Malta: Proof of health insurance is required for visa processing.<br>• South Korea &amp; Russia: All international students must have valid insurance during their studies.<br><br>By choosing Insaf Immigration, you are guaranteed full compliance with all regulations, avoiding delays in visa approvals.</p>', '2026-01-15 06:38:10', '2026-01-15 06:38:10'),
(7, 7, '[]', '<p>Health insurance ensures that students:<br>• Have access to quality healthcare without financial burden.<br>• Avoid stress and complications in case of medical emergencies.<br>• Can travel confidently knowing they are protected.<br>• Focus entirely on academic and personal growth.<br><br>Secure Your Health, Protect Your Future – With Insaf Immigration Studying abroad should be a journey of growth, learning, and adventure—not stress or worry about medical emergencies. Insaf Immigration ensures your health is fully protected so you can focus on your dreams.<br><br>Contact us today to get your student health insurance and start your international education journey with confidence.</p>', '2026-01-15 06:39:19', '2026-01-15 06:39:19');

