(8, 'Thousands of Dreams Turned into Reality!', 'Join hundreds of students who got their visas through Insaf Immigration. Fast, reliable, and 100% resultoriented service!', 'uploads/sliders/1768367679-3dcCYQbyXV.png', 1, '2026-01-07 23:06:50', '2026-01-18 06:12:07', NULL, 'Get Your Visa!'),
