INSERT INTO `visa_item_sections` (`id`, `visa_item_id`, `images`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(2, 2, '[]', '<p>Securing a student visa is the most critical step in the study abroad journey. A single mistake in documentation or justification can result in visa refusal, delays, or future complications.&nbsp;<br>At Insaf Immigration, we provide end-to-end student visa services from Bangladesh, ensuring accuracy, compliance, and the highest possible approval success. As a trusted student visa consultancy in Bangladesh, we guide students and parents through every stage of the visa process with professionalism, transparency, and proven expertise.</p>', '2025-12-18 00:31:26', '2026-01-18 05:00:30'),
(9, 3, '[]', '<p>Our student visa service is a complete professional solution designed to help Bangladeshi students successfully obtain study visas for top international destinations.<br>This service includes:<br>• Visa eligibility assessment<br>• Complete documentation support<br>• SOP and interview preparation<br>• Embassy and VFS guidance<br>We focus on visa approval strategy, not just application submission.</p>', '2026-01-18 04:48:35', '2026-01-18 04:48:35'),
(10, 9, '[]', '<p>We carefully assess:<br>• Academic background and progression<br>• Study gap analysis<br>• Financial strength and sponsorship<br>• Course and country selection<br>• Potential visa risk factors<br>This allows us to build a country-specific and profile-based visa strategy</p>', '2026-01-18 04:50:45', '2026-01-18 04:50:45'),
(11, 5, '[]', '<p>Our experts assist with:<br>• Visa application forms<br>• Financial documents and bank statements<br>• Sponsor documents<br>• Academic file arrangement<br>• Health insurance and medical requirements<br>Every document is prepared according to embassy and high commission standards.</p>', '2026-01-18 04:51:06', '2026-01-18 04:51:06'),
(12, 6, '[]', '<p>A strong SOP is one of the most important elements of a successful visa application. We provide:<br>• SOP structure and content guidance<br>• Study and career justification logic<br>• Embassy-specific SOP alignment<br>• Mock interview preparation (where applicable)<br>This significantly increases student visa approval chances.</p>', '2026-01-18 04:51:27', '2026-01-18 04:51:27');
INSERT INTO `visa_item_sections` (`id`, `visa_item_id`, `images`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(13, 7, '[]', '<p>We support students with:<br>• Online visa application submission<br>• VFS appointment booking<br>• Biometrics and document submission guidance<br>• Final pre-appointment briefing<br>Students attend their visa appointment fully prepared and confident</p><p>.<img style=\"width: 50%;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"visa_guidance.png\"></p>', '2026-01-18 04:52:05', '2026-01-18 04:52:05');
INSERT INTO `visa_item_sections` (`id`, `visa_item_id`, `images`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(14, 8, '[]', '<p>Insaf Immigration offers professional visa services for:<br>• Australia<br>• United Kingdom<br>• Canada<br>• United States of America<br>• Europe (Malta, Cyprus, Lithuania and others)<br>• Malaysia<br>• Japan<br>• South Korea<br>• Russia</p><p>Each country has unique visa rules, and our team handles them with country-specific expertise.</p>', '2026-01-18 04:53:01', '2026-01-18 04:53:01'),
(15, 11, '[]', '<p>Our visa service is suitable for:<br>• SSC, HSC, O-Level, A-Level students<br>• Diploma, Bachelor’s, and Master’s applicants<br>• Students with study gaps<br>• IELTS and non-IELTS applicants<br>• Self-funded and sponsored students<br>We design custom visa solutions, not generic files.</p>', '2026-01-18 04:53:39', '2026-01-18 04:53:39'),
(16, 12, '[]', '<p>Most student visa refusals occur due to:<br>• Weak or illogical SOP<br>• Incorrect financial documentation<br>• Wrong course or country selection<br>• Lack of academic justification</p><p><br>With Insaf Immigration’s visa service, students benefit from:<br>• Higher visa success rate<br>• Reduced rejection risk<br>• Strong academic and financial logic</p><p>• Clear step-by-step guidance</p>', '2026-01-18 04:54:44', '2026-01-18 04:54:44'),
(17, 13, '[]', '<p>Insaf Immigration is a reliable and result-driven student visa agency in Bangladesh because we offer:<br>• Experienced visa specialists<br>• Country-specific visa knowledge<br>• Honest and ethical guidance<br>• Strong understanding of embassy requirements<br>• Transparent process with no hidden charges<br>• Proven student visa success record<br>We focus on longterm student success, not false guarantees.</p>', '2026-01-18 04:55:22', '2026-01-18 04:55:22'),
(18, 14, '[]', '<p>Visa approval depends heavily on correct admission selection.<br>We ensure:<br>• Course relevance supports visa logic<br>• University choice aligns with embassy trends<br>• Financial planning meets visa requirements<br>This integrated approach greatly improves overall visa approval outcomes</p>', '2026-01-18 04:55:57', '2026-01-18 04:55:57'),
(19, 15, '[]', '<p>If you are planning to apply for a student visa from Bangladesh, professional visa support is essential. With Insaf Immigration, you receive expert handling, honest advice, and proven<br>strategies.<br><br>Contact Insaf Immigration today for a visa consultation and take the next step toward your international education goal.</p>', '2026-01-18 04:56:41', '2026-01-18 04:56:41');

